   :verified
   {:at "2026-08-31"
    :how "GET /ipfs/{cid}?format=raw with Accept: application/vnd.ipld.raw 301s to the subdomain gateway and answers 200; the returned bytes were re-hashed and reproduced the requested CID for all three CIDs reachable from the live head advertisement (442, 46 and 442 bytes). The redirect is not a fault: following it yields verifiable bytes."}}
  {:host "kotobase.net"
